WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for t1-09-insecurity-anchor.mp3 — machine-transcribed on-device from the existing audio (SR-472). Not proofread.
NOTE Cues with ids phase-recognise/-regulate/-release/-rise mark where each step begins; js/saferise-poster.js reads them.

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:03.000
You feel that?

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.150
It is already running now.

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.130
The internal checking

00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:20.480
Monitoring how you're sitting, how you're looking, whether you're breathing
correctly.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:24.170
Wondering whether you are finally doing everything right.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:37.540
We are going to take that entirely off the table.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:48.220
There is nothing to achieve here and absolutely nothing to get right.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.250
Two honest things before we go further because they will save you the effort
of testing me.

00:01:07.930 --> 00:01:10.100
I am not going to assess you.

00:01:18.040 --> 00:01:24.060
Not your posture, not your stillness, not how deeply you manage to feel any of
this.

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.910
Nobody is watching and I am not keeping score.

00:01:37.220 --> 00:01:40.700
There is no version of the next few minutes that you fail.

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:41.920
Second, second,

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.430
And this is why most of this kind of thing slides off you.

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:48.240
I am not going to tell you that you are enough.

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:54.500
Not because it isn't true, because you would check the source, weigh it, and
set it aside.

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:58.340
The way you have it with every reassurance you ever have.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:05.070
So I will leave that argument alone and we will work on something the checking
cannot reach.

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:13.550
One more thing,

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:20.930
In a minute the checking will start checking whether it is checking correctly,
no? Whether you are relaxing properly.

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:22.770
Whether this is working yet

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:25.980
When that happens, you have not gone wrong.

00:02:26.260 --> 00:02:29.380
You have just watched the machine run one more loop.

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:32.980
That is the most useful thing that can happen in here.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:42.410
The physical bracing fires first

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:47.260
While the grounded presence that knows you belong here takes a moment to
arrive.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:51.700
Most of your exhaustion lives in the space where those two collide.

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:57.290
A tree does not check its roots to see whether it has earned the ground. No?

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:58.410
It stands.

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.250
And the standing is the proof.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.130
Four clear phases.

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:04.780
I will walk you through them so

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.290
Let's find where this doubt actually sits.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:11.650
Just recognizing it, changing nothing. Often it is in the chest.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.820
Not a heavy weight but a hollow unsteadiness

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:19.000
It might be a sudden tightness in the throat just before you speak.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:22.820
Or hands that urgently need something to hold.

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.460
Keep this physical state a single word

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:36.420
Stay with that a moment

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:37.890
Don't move past it

00:03:44.240 --> 00:03:46.410
That word is doing something precise.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:49.620
It describes how your physical body is standing.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:52.470
It says nothing about what you are worth.

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:59.930
Because this state arrives with an opinion attached and it presents that
opinion as a fact you have finally uncovered.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:06.850
Nor enough.

00:04:13.870 --> 00:04:14.570
Found out,

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:24.470
A fraud. We are not going to argue with any of that.

00:04:24.940 --> 00:04:29.310
Arguing gives it something to answer and it always has an answer ready.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.560
But notice I just happened

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:41.760
You felt a physical state and something quieter in you observed it.

00:04:48.220 --> 00:04:49.750
The opinion is in the room

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:51.700
You are the one watching it.

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:53.550
Stay there for a full breath

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:02.570
That is not a technique.

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:04.370
That is the whole thing.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:07.790
An opinion being loud has never made it true.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:18.440
And the part of you that noticed it is not the part that made it.

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:21.790
Leave the vulnerability exactly where it is.

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:24.000
Nothing here needs so big.

00:05:30.150 --> 00:05:32.280
Now we let the body regulate

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.200
This is the part that cannot be done badly.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:38.480
A breath cannot be graded and neither can a harm.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.660
Draw a slow breath in for 6 counts.

00:05:48.050 --> 00:05:49.860
And release it for 6 counts.

00:05:50.520 --> 00:05:52.640
Keep the rhythm even, both ways.

00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:02.270
Lose the count as often as you like.

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:03.660
It does not matter.

00:06:04.040 --> 00:06:08.030
Your hands are once something to hold, so give them something real.

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:10.140
Rest one hand on your chest.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.740
Or simply hold your own forearm.

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:22.960
That is not symbolic.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:29.340
Contact is a whatsaddles a nervous system and yours is the nearest available

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.770
Now the throat,

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:42.350
Since that is where this leaves when you are about to speak.

00:06:48.810 --> 00:06:53.320
Let your joy come apart, let your tongue drop from the roof of your mouth.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:06.550
A gripped thrive changes your voice before you say a single word.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:16.270
Let your shoulders come down away from your ears.

00:07:16.690 --> 00:07:20.710
And let that hollow in your chest be there without bracing around it.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:24.150
On your next out breath, let alone home come.

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:26.410
Quiet just enough to feel.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:35.410
The chest

00:07:35.630 --> 00:07:37.370
The throat behind the face.

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.300
There is no correct harm.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:43.930
That is why it is here. Let it fade on its own instead of stopping it.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.250
Two or three is plenty

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:52.690
Now bring your attention into the center of your chest and keep the breath
moving through that point.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:07:58.540
And while it moves, bring to mind someone you love.

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:03.540
Not someone who admires you or approves of you, someone you love.

00:08:03.980 --> 00:08:06.790
Hold that study at your chest while you breathe.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.650
Loving is not a performance.

00:08:18.080 --> 00:08:23.210
There is no standard to meet in it and the part of you that audits cannot
score it.

00:08:23.700 --> 00:08:25.440
That is why we are using it.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.970
Press your feet firmly into the floor.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.460
Feel the solid earth to push back.

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:33.150
Your internal state is unsteady.

00:08:40.070 --> 00:08:41.110
The floor is not

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.960
Thoughts of inadequacy will spike.

00:08:44.320 --> 00:08:47.110
Let each one arrive without pushing it away.

00:08:47.440 --> 00:08:50.500
Following its logic or letting it finish its sentence

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:54.900
A thought turning up is just a checking doing its rounds.

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.070
It is not asking you to act.

00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:06.490
And if you catch yourself working hard at this ease of

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:11.210
A third here means you have started competing with your own shadow

00:09:11.710 --> 00:09:16.870
Stay in the rhythm a little longer. This is the part most people abandon too
early.
